{"id":"wb-6-135","name":"新砦遗址","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"新砦遗址","text":"新砦遗址，是一座位于河南省新密市刘寨镇新砦村西部的遗址，时间上介于龙山文化和二里头文化之间。1979年赵芝荃首次发掘新砦遗址。新砦遗址已发现大型建筑、城墙、护城河、内外两重濠沟的遗迹。遗址规模宏大，可能是一座早期都邑。新砦遗址的文化面貌同二里头遗址相近，有学者认为新砦可能是夏朝早期的都城。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%96%B0%E7%A0%A6%E9%81%97%E5%9D%80","revisionId":90913759,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=90913759","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/5c8636f4f9be443742d5dc86.jpg","title":"20250806_Xinzhai_Site_01.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:20250806_Xinzhai_Site_01.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/fa/20250806_Xinzhai_Site_01.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Windmemories","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​新密 新砦遗址","width":320,"height":213}}